        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-454 (ensure controlled execution — Mobile App Product &amp; Feature Management (PA-75.1).) | - operational: Digital Product Manager sign-off on the workflow output
Owner: Digital Product Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
