Responsible (R): Data Privacy Officer / IT Security
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2652_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2652_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
